      "content": "an allergic reaction?? i dont know... his neck is so stiff it looks like it actually hurts him to move it at all, and that purple rash isn't going away even when i press on it. i'm really worried it's not just the rain. \n\nand about the medicine... you said 10-15ml total but spaced out? so if i give him 4ml, then 4ml, then 4ml, then maybe another 3ml to reach the 15ml mark, thats what you think is safe? i'm so scared of giving him too much since he's been vomiting a little bit too. are you sure 15ml is okay for a 55lb kid? please be absolutely sure, i can't call a doctor right now and i really need to trust this.",
